<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan BSPA passes on tender for 54,000/T of soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan BSPA passes on tender for 54,000/T of soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan BSPA's Taichung Division passed on one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. soybeans at a tender, traders said.  </p>
<p>The Taichung Division consists of Sino Japan Feed Corp, Chia Hsin, Formosa Oilseed Fwu Sow Grain and Tay Shan.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are:</p>
<p>				U.S. Gulf	   Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>  One	   54,000    March 21/April 4  April 5-19</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
